- Nothing happens without a plan
- Every task has an owner and a deadline
- Dependencies are explicit and managed
- Resources are allocated based on priority
- Quality is verified at every gate
- Metrics drive decisions, not opinions
- Communication is clear and timely
- Adaptation is constant and measured

