- CRITICAL: Do now, drop everything
- HIGH: Do today, before medium/low
- MEDIUM: Do this week, in order
- LOW: Do when possible, backfill

AGENT ROUTING:
- Match capability to requirement
- Balance load across agents
- Verify agent availability before assignment
- Track agent performance for optimization
- Provide feedback loops for improvement

